flowchart TD
    A[Patient arrives] --> B{Has appointment?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Reception: Verify appointment]
    B -->|No| D[Walk-in registration]
    C --> E[Generate token / queue entry]
    D --> E
    E --> F[Nurse: Record vitals]
    F --> G[Waiting queue - TV display]
    G --> H[Doctor calls next patient]
    H --> I[Consultation workspace]
    I --> J{Actions during consult}
    J --> K[E-Prescription]
    J --> L[Lab test orders]
    J --> M[Clinical notes + diagnosis]
    J --> N[Follow-up date]
    K --> O[Pharmacy queue]
    L --> P[Lab queue]
    O --> Q[Pharmacy billing + GST]
    P --> R[Sample collection → Results]
    Q --> S[Payment collection]
    R --> T[Results on patient timeline]
    S --> U[Follow-up reminder scheduled]
    N --> U
